<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan to auction T$35 bln bonds in November.</title>
<headline>Taiwan to auction T$35 bln bonds in November.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's central bank, on behalf of the finance ministry, would auction T$35 billion in seven-year government bonds on November 15, a central bank official said on Friday.</p>
<p>The coupon rate on the bonds was set at 6.60 percent.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
